WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.750
A village begins with one Worker’s Chest.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:10.500
Add a rod and a loaf of bread,
and a villager takes up fishing.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.500
The catch pays the farmer,
who grows wheat for the baker.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
The baker turns wheat into bread.
Some goes to wages, some to lunch.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.250
Supply the materials,
and workers build their own homes.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:30.750
Bring a miner along and show them where to dig.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.250
After dark, guards keep the village safe.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.000
Doctors help injured workers recover.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Then it’s time for karaoke.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.000
[ Karaoke ♪ ]

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.750
Bedrock Workers. A Minecraft Bedrock add-on
from Forty-Seven Sunset Studios.
